I want to have 3d skins.
It should be layers of 2d images, that move laterally as my phones orientation changes (as I tilt it in the air) to create a 3d effect.
I dont want the layers to have a tilt effect, they should just move to create the illusion of depth.
Lets try this out with 3 layers of plain colour to see what its like.

